    "estimated": "4.00 occ x 15 min/occ (estimate, mid of 5-40, basis inferred, 4 quotes from 4 occurrences) = 60.00 min = 4.52 min/mo; automatable 60% (estimate) = 2.71 min/mo; at the low end 5 min/occ = $2.51/mo, at the high end 40 min/occ = $11.47/mo (the row's automatable total)",
    "total": "today 5.88 min/mo = 0.10 h/mo = $8.33/mo (email 1.36 min/mo = $1.93 + work 4.52 min/mo = $6.40); automatable 3.58 min/mo = 0.06 h/mo = $5.07/mo (counted email 0.87 min/mo = $1.23 + estimated work 2.71 min/mo = $3.84)"
  },
